version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-26
abstract: >-
  A research-preview laboratory for bounded GPU workload investigation,
  reproducible verification records, hypothesis tracking, and learned
  intervention selection. CPU controls do not establish CUDA performance.
keywords:
  - GPU performance
  - reproducible benchmarking
  - Triton
  - performance diagnosis
  - intervention selection
